{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "streaming/a-generation-a-fallback-serves-names-it-on-what-it-told-and-on-its-cut",
  "title": "A generation the router handed to a fallback names the fallback on the input it told as its stream started and on what it used once a steering Cancel cut it",
  "rules": [
    "§6.1",
    "§6.4 The turn's record",
    "§21.3"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-10.6.8-020",
    "RK-6.1-005",
    "RK-6.4-436",
    "RK-6.4-439",
    "RK-6.4-441",
    "RK-6.7-020"
  ],
  "notes": "RMK-369 (HITL 242a9f5e). The primary refuses, the fallback tells its input, then holds; the Cancel stops it. Python: channels/_ai_resilience.py (the loop's serving provider), channels/_ai_streaming.py _told_usage and _stream_generation. roomkit-rs: tool_loop/resilience.rs rerouted.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "ws",
        "type": "websocket",
        "category": "transport",
        "streams": true,
        "reads_usage": true
      },
      {
        "id": "agent",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "name": "opus",
          "provider": "anthropic",
          "rounds": [
            {
              "refuses": {
                "status": 503,
                "message": "overloaded",
                "retryable": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "retry_policy": {
          "max_retries": 0,
          "base_delay_ms": 1
        },
        "fallback_model": {
          "name": "gpt",
          "provider": "openai",
          "rounds": [
            {
              "usage_at_start": {
                "input_tokens": 40
              },
              "gate": "second",
              "text": "Never.",
              "usage": {
                "input_tokens": 40,
                "output_tokens": 7
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "ws"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "agent",
            "category": "intelligence"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "ws",
        "sender_id": "alice",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Go."
        }
      },
      "background": true,
      "as": "a"
    },
    {
      "wait_for": "second"
    },
    {
      "call": "steer",
      "channel_id": "agent",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "directive": {
        "type": "cancel"
      }
    },
    {
      "open": "second"
    },
    {
      "await": "a"
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "streamed": {
      "room-1": {
        "ws": [
          {
            "usage": {
              "input_tokens": 40
            },
            "partial": true,
            "model": "gpt",
            "provider": "openai"
          },
          {
            "usage": {
              "input_tokens": 40
            },
            "partial": false,
            "model": "gpt",
            "provider": "openai"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
